  "title": {
   "en": "There's Something Wrong About My Man's Morals"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "My Lover's Personality Is a Little Strange"
   },
   {
    "ko": "내 남자의 인성이 조금 이상하다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After a fateful encounter as children, Evonne and the outcast prince, Theo, can’t deny their deep connection. However, their lives are torn apart when Evonne’s family is wrongly accused of treason, leading to their ruin. Cursed and forced to disguise herself as a man, Evonne struggles to survive until Theo finally finds her and uses all his power as emperor to take her with him. Together, they’ll start a journey facing challenges that’ll test their love as they try to start a life together."
  },
